2026-10-07T15:46:36.9948844Z [1;31m│[0m Which features depend on this varies by configuration. When enabled, the PR summary comment aggregator and test-log / BEP / profile artifact uploads all ride on the ArtifactService — any of those features will be affected until the permission is granted. The task itself completes regardless.
